WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.260
All right guys, so this is an example for a short position.

00:04.260 --> 00:08.100
So as you can see, we got the A leg, right?

00:08.100 --> 00:11.060
So let me mark this out very easily.

00:11.060 --> 00:11.900
There you go.

00:11.900 --> 00:14.300
We got the A leg, we got the B leg,

00:14.300 --> 00:16.380
and then we got the C leg.

00:16.380 --> 00:17.340
Perfect.

00:17.340 --> 00:19.300
So now let me mark these out.

00:19.300 --> 00:21.860
So we got the A leg right around here,

00:21.860 --> 00:24.500
which is from here, okay?

00:25.680 --> 00:29.700
And then we got the B leg, okay?

00:29.700 --> 00:34.700
Which is the B leg, this downward move.

00:35.420 --> 00:38.620
So we wanna mark out the very low of the B leg,

00:38.620 --> 00:40.040
which is this, okay?

00:41.920 --> 00:45.200
And we wanna mark out the high of the A leg,

00:46.860 --> 00:48.740
which is this, perfect.

00:50.260 --> 00:55.260
Now the C leg, which is this,

00:55.260 --> 01:00.260
it takes out the high of the A leg, okay?

01:03.100 --> 01:05.600
So the high of the A leg is here,

01:06.640 --> 01:09.220
A leg high, right?

01:12.200 --> 01:16.480
Let me do this, it looks better, there you go.

01:17.600 --> 01:21.840
So the C leg takes out the high of the A leg

01:22.680 --> 01:27.680
while leaving some structure here, right?

01:28.560 --> 01:33.280
So before price took out this high,

01:33.280 --> 01:35.860
it created some structure, okay?

01:37.000 --> 01:42.000
Then when price took out the high,

01:42.240 --> 01:45.440
it made a market structure shift.

01:45.440 --> 01:50.440
So it broke this structure, right?

01:52.560 --> 01:57.560
Then price left the imbalance and auto block.

01:59.160 --> 02:01.720
So this is an auto block, right?

02:02.920 --> 02:05.320
We would enter straight from the auto block,

02:10.040 --> 02:12.520
put our stop-loss right above there

02:12.520 --> 02:16.200
and target the low, which is here.

02:16.200 --> 02:18.160
So that's 5.62, guys.

